 from Chaotic Enemies.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Belt Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Belt Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Planar_Gird.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Planar_Gird.png/420px-Planar_Gird.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"407\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Planar_Gird.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Catalyst_Crafting\" title=\"Catalyst Crafting\">Catalyst Crafting</a> to \n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Item:Planar_Lariat\" title=\"Item:Planar Lariat\">Planar Lariat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Item:Legendary_Planar_Lariat\" title=\"Item:Legendary Planar Lariat\">Legendary Planar Lariat</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This belt of interlocking silver disks is emblazoned with a mark of True Law. Several pieces are bent and blistered from intense heat.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816153503\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.094 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.151 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2782/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21083/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4606/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 2/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n144.21%  188.612     39 Template:IO\n100.00%  130.791      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  130.791      1 -total\n 96.88%  126.705      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 48.34%   63.225      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 47.34%   61.920      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 46.20%   60.421      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 44.94%   58.776      2 Template:InCategory\n 24.23%   31.690      5 Template:Popup\n 22.43%   29.337      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:11372-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816153503 and revision id 693921. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
